# Phase 11 (docs/phase11-brief.md 3.6, 7 criterion 8; D3, COMP-7):
# Settings > Reset Settings. The light prompt with Reset | Cancel, Cancel
# preselected; Cancel changes nothing; Reset puts the stock-visible
# settings back (Time in Title Off again), then the Language list, then
# the main menu. No font or skin reload.
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p11-reset.script
# needs: library
# log: reset: settings n=
# log: reset: language done
# nolog: font_load
#
# Needs U2a's row wiring (Settings row 17 -> ui_reset_screen).

wait 4000
wheel +3             # Settings
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 1500
wheel +1             # Shuffle
wait 400
key SELECT           # Shuffle -> Songs (something to reset)
wait 600
wheel +15            # Reset Settings
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 1500
shot prompt          # Cancel preselected
key SELECT           # Cancel: back, nothing reset
wait 1200
shot cancelled       # Shuffle still reads Songs
key SELECT           # the prompt again
wait 1500
wheel -1             # Reset
wait 500
shot reset_selected
key SELECT
wait 1500
shot language        # "English", the Welcome panel
key SELECT
wait 1500
shot main_menu       # back at the root
# Settings is still selected on the main menu: Shuffle reads Off again
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 1500
shot settings_after
quit
